---
// src/pages/ddos-detection-automation.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="DDoS Detection & Automation (FastNetMon Advanced) | InfraHub"
  description="Evaluate FastNetMon for near-real-time network-layer DDoS detection, BGP FlowSpec, RTBH automation, and external scrubbing-centre diversion."
  canonicalPath="/ddos-detection-automation"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container service-container">
      <div class="service-header">
        <div class="header-badge-row">
          <span class="pill-badge badge-blue">Flow Telemetry</span>
          <span class="pill-badge badge-teal">Partner Delivered</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="service-title">DDoS Detection & BGP Automation</h1>
        <p class="service-lead">
          FastNetMon analyzes live network telemetry to detect network-layer DDoS activity in near real time. Operators can use it to trigger policy-defined responses including BGP FlowSpec, remote-triggered blackholing (RTBH), and diversion to external scrubbing infrastructure.
        </p>
        <div class="service-hero-actions">
          <a href="/partners/fastnetmon" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Explore FastNetMon</a>
          <a href="/offers/fastnetmon-ddos-detection-100g" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">View FastNetMon Offer</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <span class="section-sub-tag">Telemetry & Mitigation Control</span>
        <h2>How FastNetMon Fits a DDoS Response Stack</h2>
        <div class="problem-grid">
          <div class="problem-card">
            <h3>Out-of-Band Analysis</h3>
            <p>FastNetMon can ingest network telemetry such as sFlow, NetFlow, IPFIX, and mirrored traffic without placing the detection engine inline with normal packet forwarding.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-card">
            <h3>BGP FlowSpec</h3>
            <p>Operator-defined FlowSpec policies can distribute targeted filtering rules to compatible routers, allowing selected malicious traffic patterns to be filtered without blackholing all traffic to the destination.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-card">
            <h3>RTBH & Scrubbing Diversion</h3>
            <p>FastNetMon can automate remote-triggered blackholing or trigger diversion toward external scrubbing infrastructure when the operator's thresholds and escalation rules are met.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-footer-cta">
        <h2>Evaluate DDoS Detection for Your Network</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?service=ddos-detection" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Discuss Your DDoS Architecture</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .service-header { text-align: left; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 0 64px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .header-badge-row { display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .service-title { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .service-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .service-hero-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .content-section { margin-bottom: 72px; }
  .section-sub-tag { display: block; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .content-section h2 { font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .problem-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  .problem-card { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px; }
  .problem-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .problem-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
  .service-footer-cta { padding: 40px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
</style>
